---
import SeoMetadata from '../../components/SeoMetadata.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><SeoMetadata title="Feedback & Ideas | Help Improve EvonyMasters" description="Found a missing Evony reward, a broken tool or an idea worth sharing? Send corrections, suggestions and feedback to the EvonyMasters team."/><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<title>Feedback & Ideas | Help Improve EvonyMasters</title><meta name="description" content="Found a missing Evony reward, a broken tool or an idea worth sharing? Send corrections, suggestions and feedback to the EvonyMasters team."/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/>
<style is:global>
:root{font:16px Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#eef3f9;background:#091624}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 10%,#1b3349,transparent 40%),#091624}a{color:#f2ce8e}
.wrap{max-width:1060px;margin:auto;padding:0 24px}.eyebrow{color:#f2c778;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:.75rem;font-weight:850}
.feedback-hero{min-height:330px;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:54px 0 65px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(4,14,26,.96) 0%,rgba(5,17,31,.83) 50%,rgba(5,17,31,.25) 100%),url('/images/banners/calendar.webp') center/cover no-repeat;border-bottom:1px solid #9d7645}.feedback-hero .wrap{width:100%}.feedback-hero h1{font:700 clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.1rem)/1.12 Georgia,serif;color:#ffdf9c;margin:13px 0 16px;max-width:760px}.feedback-hero p{font-size:1.1rem;color:#e2edf6;line-height:1.7;max-width:670px;margin:0}
.content{padding-top:46px;padding-bottom:76px}.lead{text-align:center;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto 30px}.lead h2{font:700 clamp(1.75rem,3.5vw,2.4rem) Georgia,serif;color:#ffdf9c;margin:10px 0}.lead p{line-height:1.7;color:#cfdeeb}
.choices{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:17px}.choice{background:#152d43;border:1px solid #3c5b73;border-radius:15px;padding:24px;min-width:0}.choice img{width:76px;height:76px;object-fit:contain;display:block;margin-bottom:16px}.choice h3{font-size:1.2rem;color:#ffe0aa;margin:0 0 9px}.choice p{color:#cbdbe9;line-height:1.65;margin:0}
.contact-panel{margin:32px 0 0;background:linear-gradient(115deg,#183b51,#12283c);border:1px solid #9d7d4e;border-radius:17px;padding:32px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:22px;align-items:center}.contact-panel h2{font:700 1.75rem Georgia,serif;color:#ffe0a2;margin:8px 0 12px}.contact-panel p{color:#d3e0eb;line-height:1.7}.button{display:inline-block;padding:14px 18px;background:#ecc57d;color:#17283b;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:850;text-align:center}.contact-actions{text-align:center}.contact-actions .button{width:100%;max-width:310px}.note{font-size:.86rem;color:#bfd0dd}.tips{margin-top:42px}.tips h2{color:#f3d28e;font:700 1.5rem Georgia,serif}.tips p{line-height:1.75;color:#ccdaea}.tips a{color:#f5cf8b}footer{margin-top:42px;border-top:1px solid #375168;padding-top:22px;color:#b9cbd9;font-size:.87rem}
@media(max-width:800px){.choices{grid-template-columns:1fr}.choice{display:grid;grid-template-columns:80px 1fr;gap:5px 16px;align-items:start}.choice img{grid-row:span 2;margin:0}.contact-panel{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
@media(max-width:520px){.wrap{padding:0 18px}.feedback-hero{padding:44px 0 52px;min-height:300px}.choice{display:block}.choice img{margin-bottom:16px}.contact-panel{padding:24px}}
</style></head><body><SiteHeader active="contact"/>
<main><section class="feedback-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Help shape EvonyMasters</div><h1>Got an idea? Found something we missed?</h1><p>Your feedback helps turn EvonyMasters into the place players can trust when they need a reward, a plan or a quick answer. Tell us what would make your next visit better.</p></div></section>
<div class="wrap content"><section aria-labelledby="feedback-heading"><div class="lead"><div class="eyebrow">Your voice counts</div><h2 id="feedback-heading">Three great reasons to get in touch</h2><p>Every useful correction and suggestion helps make the tools better for the next player.</p></div>
<div class="choices">
<div class="choice"><img src="/images/item-finder/ymir.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"/><h3>Found a data mistake?</h3><p>Missing monster, wrong chest contents, unclear rewards? Tell us what needs another look.</p></div>
<div class="choice"><img src="/images/item-finder/box.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"/><h3>Something not working?</h3><p>Broken search, odd calculation or a display problem? Point us to the page and what happened.</p></div>
<div class="choice"><img src="/images/item-finder/feasting-revelry.svg" alt="" loading="lazy"/><h3>Have a tool idea?</h3><p>If it would make Evony easier to play or plan, we'd love to hear what you're imagining.</p></div>
</div></section>
<section class="contact-panel"><div><div class="eyebrow">Send a message</div><h2>Help us build a better toolkit</h2><p>Send a correction, suggestion or question to the EvonyMasters team. A few details make it easier for us to investigate.</p><p class="note">Please don't include passwords, account credentials or other sensitive information.</p></div><div class="contact-actions"><a class="button" href="mailto:contact@evonymasters.com?subject=EvonyMasters%20Feedback">Email the EvonyMasters team →</a><p><a href="mailto:contact@evonymasters.com">contact@evonymasters.com</a></p></div></section>
<section class="tips"><h2>How to send a helpful report</h2><p>Include the tool or page, the item or monster you searched for, what you expected and what happened instead. For reward corrections, an in-game source and date are especially helpful. Sharing the site with your alliance and suggesting missing data are other great ways to help.</p><p>Want to see what we're building? <a href="/about/">Explore what EvonyMasters is all about</a>, or <a href="/resources/">jump into Item Finder</a>.</p></section>
<footer><a href="/">Home</a> · <a href="/about/">About</a> · <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></footer></div>
</main></body></html>